  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5301.30 Written evaluation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.30 \"Written evaluation\" means a BRC or ERC training course written or electronic test examination to be completed by each student in order to successfully pass a motorcycle rider education program course.\n\nSource. #14174, eff 1-17-25 (formerly Saf-C 5301.28)",
